{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんごっっ(o・・o)\nさゆりんごっっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログ\n興奮しすぎて\nさゆりんごっっ(o・・o)っての\n忘れてた////どうでもいいがっ////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、雑誌買うよーって言ってくださる皆さん\n優しすぎます(;_;)\n大好きです(;_;)(;_;)(;_;)(;_;)\nありがとうございます(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はすごくポカポカな日でしたね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう春なんかな〜？\n春は大好きな季節なんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年から花粉症でして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ　くしゃみしちゃうんよ〜(ノ_・,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お目めもごしごし\nしたくなるんよ〜(ノ_・,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん花粉症大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は君の名は希望の\n握手会です＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお会いするんは\n１ヵ月ぶりなんかな〜(^^)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張すんね/////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何話す〜////？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題ないよ〜(;_;)\n緊張するよ〜(;_;)\n何話したらええんよ〜(;_;)って皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問です♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレイボーイの\nどの松村がお好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからもう１つ！\n今回のカップリングに\nロマンティックいか焼きという曲があるのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村のソロパートは\nどこでしょう！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいかな〜(ノ_・,)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ気軽にお答えくださいっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られない皆さんも\nコメントお待ちしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、明日も一日\n楽しみましょう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんでしたっ(o・・o)/~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいませっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/03/15/5683740/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}